+data. The caller must release the stream via `out_stream->release(out_stream)` when done (unconsumed batches are
+released with it).
+
+* @param result The result to consume. Must have been produced by `duckdb_pending_prepared_arrow`.
+* @param out_stream The output stream structure to fill. Yields one ArrowArray per collected record batch.
+* @return The error data. Must be destroyed with `duckdb_destroy_error_data`.
+*/
+DUCKDB_C_API duckdb_error_data duckdb_result_arrow_array_stream(duckdb_result *result,
+                                                                struct ArrowArrayStream *out_stream);
